WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.684
Mei: Hi everyone, I'm Mei, and welcome to my Saturday vlog!

2
00:00:04.684 --> 00:00:08.179
Mei: Right now I'm at the ice rink in the town square.

3
00:00:08.329 --> 00:00:13.969
Mei: It's December, so it's really cold, about three degrees, and it's cloudy.

4
00:00:13.969 --> 00:00:17.955
Mei: I'm wearing a woolly hat, gloves and a big red jacket.

5
00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:24.204
Mei: Look! My brother Kai is skating behind me, and he's falling… again!

6
00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:28.198
Mei: I usually come here on Sunday afternoons with my family, just for fun.

7
00:00:28.198 --> 00:00:32.465
Mei: But today is different: I'm training for the Christmas show.

8
00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:37.717
Mei: My group is doing a dance on ice, so I'm practising my turns.

9
00:00:37.717 --> 00:00:44.957
Mei: It's difficult, but I love it. OK, back to the ice. See you next week!
